    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORD FROM THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the idea for this game came to mind I really wanted to have a grindy game I could sink my teeth into while listening to a podcast or even watching a video. With this game I tried to accomplish just that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELAX AND CATCH SOME MONSTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, relax and grab yourself a drink because Collectamon is meant to be a relaxing experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your favorite podcast or even a good video while playing. You won't be punished for anything the point of the game is just to relax and catch some monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427290/extras/RelaxAndCatch_600px.gif?t=1753718361\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a lot of upgrades for you to obtain while playing. Catch monsters to earn collectacoins and upgrade your character to catch monsters faster and more efficient. You can even upgrade the area to make more monsters spawn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427290/extras/Upgrades_600px.gif?t=1753718361\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DONE RELAXING?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want some action in between relaxing? Update 0.2 adds a boss monster for you to catch! Grind out the boss summoning item by catching monsters in the proper area and prepare yourself for a tough battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427290/extras/BossGif_600px.gif?t=1753718361\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SANCTUARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your caught monsters in your sanctuary to have them generate currency which you can spend on more upgrades! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPER RARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are very lucky you might find rare shiny Collectamon...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORD FROM THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the idea for this game came to mind I really wanted to have a grindy game I could sink my teeth into while listening to a podcast or even watching a video. With this game I tried to accomplish just that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELAX AND CATCH SOME MONSTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, relax and grab yourself a drink because Collectamon is meant to be a relaxing experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your favorite podcast or even a good video while playing. You won't be punished for anything the point of the game is just to relax and catch some monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427290/extras/RelaxAndCatch_600px.gif?t=1753718361\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a lot of upgrades for you to obtain while playing. Catch monsters to earn collectacoins and upgrade your character to catch monsters faster and more efficient. You can even upgrade the area to make more monsters spawn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427290/extras/Upgrades_600px.gif?t=1753718361\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DONE RELAXING?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want some action in between relaxing? Update 0.2 adds a boss monster for you to catch! Grind out the boss summoning item by catching monsters in the proper area and prepare yourself for a tough battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427290/extras/BossGif_600px.gif?t=1753718361\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SANCTUARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your caught monsters in your sanctuary to have them generate currency which you can spend on more upgrades! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPER RARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are very lucky you might find rare shiny Collectamon...</p>",
    "short_description": "Collectamon is a creature collecting game with an additional focus on upgrades. Upgrade your character, upgrade the area and place your caught monsters in your sanctuary. Catch all monsters in the game? Upgrade Everything? Try and get all achievements? It's up to you!",
